"/arc-plc/north-carolina/sampson-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, September to October and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025, September to October ran 64% of normal on the middle. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 33% of normal on the middle. Grid 17906 had its driest year in 2007 at 65%.</p>"}
